As shown in Table \ref{open-world-table}, in the open-world setting, ADWPF achieves a Recall@5 of 58.87\% and an AP@5 of 50.49\%, outperforming the best baseline, which reach only 49.71\% and 40.38\%, respectively. Even in the presence of a large number of unmonitored webpages, ADWPF still demonstrates superior accuracy compared to other baselines. Similarly, we increase the value of k to better observe how model performance scales, as illustrated in Fig.\ref{open-world-fig}.
