We conducted experiments across 15 datasets, evaluating our method's effectiveness and universality in terms of Peak Performance, Mean Performance, and Standard Deviation. We also plotted clustering metrics as functions of $\rho$ to demonstrate IR-ART's performance improvement and robustness to $\rho$ variations. Finally, we visualized the execution process of IR-ART, showcasing its advantages through a real case.

