\subsection{Dynamics}
\label{sec:framework_dynamics}

Elements of framework dynamics are fixed in each system configuration at runtime.
They instantiate the statics and must be stored and communicated by agents.
\Cref{fig:framework_architecture} illustrates the agents' partial views on some dynamic system configuration.


