Below, we clarify the usage of \brane by enumerating the kinds of its constituent services and overview their roles and interactions.
They are listed in an order that suggests the progression of a successful workflow execution from top to bottom:
\begin{enumerate}
    \item A \textbf{driver} defines computational workflows: directed acyclic diagrams expressing the functional dependencies.
    Each result (data) depends on a containerised function (data) and arguments (data).
