\caption{Pareto fronts of \texttt{BLEU score} (accuracy) versus model compression ratio obtained from design space exploration. The Pareto fronts correspond to the design points of SVD Iterative (SRA) \texttt{W4A8}, highlighted in red with a cross symbol.}
\label{img:svd_quant_compression_ratio}
