% $\alpha=(\alpha_j)_{j=1}^n$ we denote by $\alpha^*$ the non-increasing rearrangement of $(|\alpha_j|)_{j=1}^n$.
% \begin{lem}\label{lem:HLP} If $a=(a_j)_{j=1}^n$ and $b=(b_j)_{j=1}^n$ are two non-negative sequences, then
