\subsection{Case Study: Neural Network Drone Controller}\label{subsec:alsomitra_experiment}
Because the training data for ACAS Xu is not publicly released, we instead consider a neural network controller with similar characteristics as a more sophisticated case study.
Our case study, proposed in~\cite{kesslerNeuralNetworkVerification2025}, revolves around a neural network controller for a gliding drone inspired by the flying seeds of \emph{Alsomitra macrocarpa}, the Javan cucumber, shown in~\cref{fig:alsomitra_seed}.
These flying seeds are capable of stable flight over long distances due to their unique shape~\cite{certiniFlightAlsomitraMacrocarpa2023}.

